DATA NOTICE: gmm

Data files tracked by DVC in this directory (fetch with `dvc pull`):
  data.tar.gz -> data

What:
  1,000 synthetic two-dimensional points for Gaussian mixture model
  clustering.

Source:
  Origin not recorded. The benchmark code comes from CUDA-GMM-MultiGPU
  (Andrew D. Pangborn; https://github.com/Corv/CUDA-GMM-MultiGPU), but
  this file is not in that repository.

Copyright:
  Unknown.

License:
  No license is stated. The BSD-3-Clause LICENSE in gmm-cuda, gmm-hip
  and gmm-sycl covers Pangborn's code; it is not established for this
  data.

Used by:
  gmm-cuda (gmm-cuda, -hip, -omp and -sycl each hold an identical copy)

Notes:
  Synthetic random points with no creative content.

This data keeps its upstream terms. HeCBench's top-level BSD-3-Clause
LICENSE does not apply to it.
